# Ordinary play for a few minutes: taking things, the door, walking to the next room, and a command on an item.
# A click's message clears with a press, so each click here has an even number of presses.

# The logos, the title, a new game, and the opening text.
.:900 T:4 .:300
A:4 .:300
40x A:3 .:60
.:120

# Choose TAKE: from EXAM, down, right, A. Up twice leaves the commands for the picture. Up and right onto the coat.
D:3 .:20 R:3 .:20 A:3 .:30
U:3 .:20 U:3 .:20 .:30 U:30 R:12 .:10
# Click it, and press A through the messages.
A:3 .:240 A:3 .:300 A:3 .:300 A:3 .:120
# Take the gun from where the coat was: the cursor is still there.
A:3 .:240 A:3 .:300 A:3 .:300 A:3 .:120

# Down out of the picture lands on OPEN. A on it, then the door, above and to the left of the coat.
D:42 .:20 A:3 .:30
U:3 .:20 U:3 .:20 .:30 U:30 L:30 .:10
A:3 .:240 A:3 .:120

# Down out of the picture onto EXAM, right twice to MOVE, and click it. Then up out of the commands into the picture, and
# onto the open doorway, which walks through to the washroom.
D:44 .:20 R:3 .:20 R:3 .:20 A:3 .:30
U:3 .:20 U:3 .:20 .:30 U:30 L:50 .:10
A:3 .:400

# Through the washroom's text. Then LEAVE, and the gun in the goods list, on the right.
4x A:3 .:240
D:52 .:40 D:3 .:40 D:3 .:40 D:3 .:40 D:3 .:40 R:3 .:40 A:3 .:40
U:3 .:40 U:3 .:40 U:3 .:40 U:3 .:40 .:30 R:120 .:20 U:60 .:20
A:3 .:240 A:3 .:120
